From: verkur46 <mohamadrezasahami1999@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 21:08:10 +0330
Subject: [PATCH 041/230] Answer malformed and oversized bodies with their own
 status, not 500
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

apiErrorHandler flattened every failure to 500, so an oversized request body
(body-parser 413) and malformed JSON (express.json SyntaxError, 400) both read
as "internal error" — a JSON client then chases a non-existent server bug.
Honour a 4xx the error already declares while keeping anything without a status
(and every 5xx) as a 500, and still log it. The errors suite now pins 400, 413
and 500 over real HTTP.

